@local/dsh-deepseek-web-panel README · dsh-deepseek-web-panel：> **Unofficial community plugin.** It uses the same desktop `<webview>` guest bridge as the shipped
> right-Sidebar Browser. That bridge is internal to the DSH desktop shell and may change in future
> releases. This project is not affiliated with DeepSeek.

@local/dsh-deepseek-web-panel README · Requirements：- **DeepSeek Harness Desktop** app. A normal browser Web GUI cannot embed the page: DeepSeek
  serves `Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'`, so an iframe is refused.
- Tested with DSH `0.2.1-rc.2` on Windows.

@local/dsh-deepseek-web-panel README · Usage：- Click **Web Chat**; log in inside the page on first use.
- A slim toolbar above the page has a reload button.
- Click a session in the left sidebar to return to the conversation.

@local/dsh-deepseek-web-panel README · 使用：- 点击「网页对话」，首次进入时在页面内登录 DeepSeek。
- 页面上方有一条细工具栏，右侧是刷新按钮，可随时重新加载。
- 点击左侧栏的会话即可切回「对话」。
